  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Taking photos of a place for two years is the work that later on found its way to a Photo book and installation. Photos are expressing the intimate experience of living and working in a studio and how photography is a means for representing the past state of life. The Photo book can be rearranged by the observer and tries to define the way of dealing with a book again. The Installation of photos on the central shelves of the studio filled with tools and stuff is an endeavor to represent the visual history database after the invention of the technical image" -- Artist's website.</subfield>
  </datafield>
